	"powerups/bubble_ready": "A bubble round the fish: once it\'s gone bubble_ready s untouched (less bubble_ready_per_stack a stack, down to bubble_ready_min), it takes the next hit instead of the fish, and pops.",
	"powerups/bubble_ready_min": "A bubble round the fish: once it\'s gone bubble_ready s untouched (less bubble_ready_per_stack a stack, down to bubble_ready_min), it takes the next hit instead of the fish, and pops.",
