	"unnatural/camera_climb": "How much of the fish\'s climb or dive it follows (0: always level).",
	"unnatural/camera_crowd_full": "The survivor cam pulls back as the horde thickens round you: up to camera_crowd_pull m further once camera_crowd_full zombies are within camera_crowd_range m; and camera_size_pull m per +100% of the Size stat, so big builds still fit. It eases there at camera_pull_rate (1/s).",
