	"unnatural/damage_numbers": "Damage numbers (the Playability pass, P3) over the zombies your hits land on. Hits on the same zombie within damage_number_merge s add up into one number (so a burning crowd stays readable); only numbers of damage_numbers_min or more show (0: all). At most damage_numbers_max at once (the oldest go first).",
